  "description": "Would you eat your adorable, talking pet vegetable?\n\nIs the argument over what’s right or wrong to eat a matter of ethics or a difference in undertanding? Ihae, a children’s story writer and vegetarian, begins each day by eating the leaf of his pet vegetable, “Aechae.” But one day, an unpleasant surprise comes his way, suddenly hurling him into a crisis...\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes two prologues.*",
